<view class="page dashboard-page" wx:if="{{profile}}">
  <view class="eyebrow">今日目标</view>
  <view class="title">{{profile.plan.dailyCalories}} 千卡</view>
  <view class="subtitle">根据你的身体信息、活动量和“{{profile.goalLabel}}”目标估算。之后记录餐食时，这里会汇总今日摄入。</view>

  <view class="section metric-grid">
    <view class="metric">
      <view class="metric-label">BMI</view>
      <view class="metric-value">{{profile.plan.bmi}}</view>
      <view class="metric-note">{{profile.plan.bmiLabel}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="metric">
      <view class="metric-label">基础代谢</view>
      <view class="metric-value">{{profile.plan.bmr}}</view>
      <view class="metric-note">千卡/日</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section panel profile-panel">
    <view class="panel-title">建档信息</view>
    <view class="info-row">
      <text>性别</text>
      <text>{{profile.genderLabel}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="info-row">
      <text>年龄</text>
      <text>{{profile.age}} 岁</text>
    </view>
    <view class="info-row">
      <text>身高 / 体重</text>
      <text>{{profile.heightCm}} cm / {{profile.weightKg}} kg</text>
    </view>
    <view class="info-row">
      <text>活动量</text>
      <text>{{profile.activityLabel}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section panel empty-meals">
    <view class="panel-title">饮食记录</view>
    <view class="muted">下一步会加入每日每餐记录；现在先完成账户和身体信息建档。</view>
  </view>
</view>
